            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Ah okay that makes sense, seeing a few other deprecated configs, it appears that all of them were renamed, so they used `vim.tbl_extend('force', vim.lsp.config.<renamed_lsp>`, which probably won't work in this case as the config might require change of options as some options were added and some were removed in the new implementation.\n\nShould I redirect it to `vim.tbl_extend('force', vim.lsp.config.ruff` anyways or is there something else that should be done in this case?",
